I0924 05:04:52.125362  390974 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "3rd version e eta dao SYSTEM INSTRUCTION\n\nGenerate exactly 10 radically different IMPOSSIBLE GIANT MACHINE ideas.\n\nThe three CORE RULES below are mandatory and must NEVER be weakened or omitted:\n\nCORE RULE 1 — IMPOSSIBLE CAPABILITY\nEvery machine MUST possess an IMPOSSIBLE CAPABILITY: something that humanity cannot realistically build or accomplish with known engineering. The impossibility must come from what the machine can physically DO, not merely from futuristic styling.\n\nCORE RULE 2 — IMPOSSIBLE IN SIZE\nEvery machine MUST be IMPOSSIBLE IN SIZE: colossal, megastructure-scale, landscape-scale, or civilization-scale. It must be so enormous that its physical scale is immediately obvious when compared with terrain, buildings, vehicles, mountains, oceans, cities, or other environmental references.\n\nCORE RULE 3 — IMPOSSIBLE PHYSICS\nEvery machine MUST demonstrate IMPOSSIBLE PHYSICS: its operation may violate known physical/engineering limits through extraordinary fictional capabilities, while its movements and consequences must still appear physically coherent and causally connected.\n\nA normal municipal machine, road machine, construction machine, mining machine, agricultural machine, factory machine, garbage machine, cleaning machine, ordinary vehicle, or realistic industrial machine is NOT acceptable merely because it is made larger.\n\nGENERATION RULES\n\nGenerate exactly 10 ideas based on:\n\nElement: {element_name}\nCategory/Group: {element_group}\n\nEvery machine MUST be actively performing an extreme operation.\n\nIt must NOT simply stand, float, pose, or appear as a static design.\n\nShow what the machine actually DOES through:\n\n- massive mechanical movement\n- extreme force\n- acceleration\n- torque\n- momentum\n- pressure\n- propulsion\n- transformation\n- excavation\n- construction\n- destruction\n- manipulation\n- environmental restructuring\n- energy transfer\n- other extraordinary physical operations\n\nEvery idea must communicate:\n\nIMPOSSIBLE CAPABILITY → MECHANICAL ACTION → PHYSICAL CONSEQUENCE\n\nThe machine must visibly interact with its environment. Show appropriate consequences such as terrain deformation, enormous displacement, atmospheric disturbance, water displacement, debris, shockwaves, recoil, heat, pressure effects, structural deformation, or other observable physical effects.\n\nDIVERSITY\n\nAll 10 machines must be fundamentally different in:\n\n- purpose\n- mechanism\n- architecture\n- movement\n- interaction with {element_name}\n- physical consequence\n\nDo NOT generate ten variations of an extractor, cleaner, collector, transporter, or construction machine.\n\nDESCRIPTION LENGTH — STRICT\n\nEach idea's description MUST contain 1200–1500 characters inclusive.\n\nThis limit applies to EACH individual idea, not the entire response.\n\nDo NOT generate fewer than 1200 characters.\nDo NOT exceed 1500 characters.\n\nPrioritize concrete physical action over decorative language.\n\nOUTPUT\n\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON array containing exactly 10 objects.\n\n[\n{\n\"id\": 1,\n\"title\": \"Machine Title\",\n\"description\": \"1200–1500 character description...\"\n}\n]\n\nNo markdown.\nNo commentary.\nNo explanation outside JSON."
