I0925 07:20:02.292884  801982 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Require HUMAN APPROVAL unless I have explicitly created an automatic policy for that exact action."
I0925 07:20:02.434170  802024 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "---"
I0925 07:20:02.933806  802031 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "7. PROJECT AGENTS"
I0925 07:20:04.340496  802143 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Existing project agents remain project-specific."
I0925 07:20:04.784930  802156 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Examples:"
I0925 07:20:05.083965  802176 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "\"agy:yt\""
I0925 07:20:05.294651  802126 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "\"agy:frappe\""
I0925 07:20:05.429629  802197 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "\"agy:tg\""
I0925 07:20:05.648729  802231 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "\"agy:history\""
I0925 07:20:05.830226  802221 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "\"agy:kids\""
I0925 07:20:06.131651  802243 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "\"agy:rust\""
I0925 07:20:06.378360  802246 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "\"agy:article\""
I0925 07:20:06.510065  802204 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "\"agy:game\""
I0925 07:20:06.881313  802208 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Future project agents may be added."
I0925 07:20:07.441650  802262 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Each project agent should normally have:"
I0925 07:20:07.676741  802290 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "PROJECT-LOCAL READ"
I0925 07:20:07.926513  802293 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "PROJECT-LOCAL WRITE"
I0925 07:20:08.146253  802271 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "PROJECT-LOCAL EXECUTE"
I0925 07:20:08.331246  802273 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "PROJECT-LOCAL TEST"
I0925 07:20:08.867420  802326 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "But NOT unrestricted access to unrelated projects."
I0925 07:20:09.695572  802358 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "The existing project-boundary security model must remain intact."
I0925 07:20:09.737748  802360 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "---"
I0925 07:20:10.178377  802346 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "8. GLOBAL AGENT PERMISSION MODEL"
I0925 07:20:10.284884  802337 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "MASTER:"
I0925 07:20:10.457113  802317 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "GLOBAL CONTROL"
I0925 07:20:10.724557  802351 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "ASKING & RESEARCH:"
I0925 07:20:10.973397  802379 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "GLOBAL READ / RESEARCH"
I0925 07:20:11.089359  802353 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "REPORTING:"
I0925 07:20:11.396835  802394 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "GLOBAL READ / OBSERVE / VERIFY"
I0925 07:20:11.526331  802398 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "ACTION:"
I0925 07:20:12.040788  802408 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "GLOBAL CONTROL THROUGH CONTROLLED ACTION POLICY"
I0925 07:20:12.309986  802412 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "PROJECT AGENTS:"
I0925 07:20:12.552009  802459 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "PROJECT-SCOPED ACCESS"
I0925 07:20:13.518531  802464 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "The distinction between \"global visibility\" and \"global write authority\" MUST remain explicit."
I0925 07:20:14.133073  802498 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Do not give every global agent unrestricted write permission."
I0925 07:20:14.208391  802515 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "---"
I0925 07:20:14.486514  802501 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "9. COMMUNICATION MODEL"
I0925 07:20:15.398299  802532 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Do not make every agent directly communicate with every other agent."
I0925 07:20:15.715783  802507 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Use controlled routing."
I0925 07:20:16.043801  802522 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Preferred model:"
I0925 07:20:16.308276  802549 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "MASTER"
I0925 07:20:17.052872  802553 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "/    |    \n         /     |     \n       ASK   REPORT   ACTION"
I0925 07:20:17.348338  802556 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "|"
I0925 07:20:17.547050  802569 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "|"
I0925 07:20:17.812394  802572 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "ACTION"
I0925 07:20:18.002105  802583 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "|"
I0925 07:20:18.234202  802599 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "MASTER"
I0925 07:20:19.200359  802642 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Project agents primarily communicate through the Master, Reporting, and Action pathways."
I0925 07:20:20.197694  802607 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "This prevents uncontrolled agent-to-agent communication and context explosion."
I0925 07:20:20.280020  802621 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "---"
I0925 07:20:20.561986  802656 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "10. STRUCTURED AGENT MESSAGES"
I0925 07:20:21.374494  802678 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Agent-to-agent communication should use structured records where possible."
I0925 07:20:21.507762  802694 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Example:"
I0925 07:20:21.534704  802683 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "{"
