I0925 07:20:28.780077  803485 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Do not depend exclusively on natural-language transcripts for machine-critical decisions."
I0925 07:20:28.834963  803512 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "---"
I0925 07:20:28.963460  803525 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "11. TASK LIFECYCLE"
I0925 07:20:29.356215  803503 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Every Master-created task should have:"
I0925 07:20:29.425442  803532 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "TASK_ID"
I0925 07:20:29.536210  803537 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "PROJECT"
I0925 07:20:29.642893  803562 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "AGENT"
I0925 07:20:29.765399  803578 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "OBJECTIVE"
I0925 07:20:29.900100  803589 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "CONSTRAINTS"
I0925 07:20:30.004126  803618 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "STATUS"
I0925 07:20:30.104927  803585 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "CREATED_AT"
I0925 07:20:30.218774  803623 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "STARTED_AT"
I0925 07:20:30.306616  803609 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "LAST_PROGRESS_AT"
I0925 07:20:30.426960  803615 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "COMPLETED_AT"
I0925 07:20:30.545299  803601 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "EVIDENCE"
I0925 07:20:30.633416  803670 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "TEST_RESULT"
I0925 07:20:30.708268  803645 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "GIT_DIFF"
I0925 07:20:30.817113  803682 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "FINAL_RESULT"
I0925 07:20:30.889768  803686 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Lifecycle:"
I0925 07:20:30.974383  803699 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "CREATED"
I0925 07:20:31.042324  803701 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "→ ASSIGNED"
I0925 07:20:31.148466  803681 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "→ RUNNING"
I0925 07:20:31.417502  803662 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "→ BLOCKED / WAITING / COMPLETED"
