I0925 07:20:31.581641  803732 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "→ CLOSED"
I0925 07:20:32.117093  803712 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "A task is NOT considered completed merely because an agent says:"
I0925 07:20:32.227866  803763 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "\"Done.\""
I0925 07:20:32.851816  803754 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Completion requires evidence appropriate to the task."
I0925 07:20:33.091121  803727 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "---\n\n12. REPORTING / MONITORING"
I0925 07:20:33.350669  803779 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Reporting Agent should monitor:"
I0925 07:20:33.525366  803761 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "1. process health"
I0925 07:20:33.694295  803799 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "2. agent activity"
I0925 07:20:33.834153  803774 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "3. task state"
I0925 07:20:34.049696  803804 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "4. transcript changes"
I0925 07:20:34.224674  803788 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "5. filesystem changes"
I0925 07:20:34.368351  803820 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "6. git state"
I0925 07:20:34.541318  803793 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "7. build/test status"
I0925 07:20:34.741766  803848 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "8. service health"
I0925 07:20:34.989257  803875 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "9. resource anomalies"
I0925 07:20:35.289070  803879 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "10. security boundary events"
I0925 07:20:35.492665  803853 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "11. WhatsApp bridge health"
I0925 07:20:35.647147  803866 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "12. Action Agent activity"
I0925 07:20:36.029471  803907 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Avoid extremely aggressive polling that wastes CPU."
I0925 07:20:36.766648  803939 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Use event-driven monitoring where practical and low-frequency polling only where necessary."
I0925 07:20:37.079982  803913 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "The server has limited CPU resources."
I0925 07:20:37.666461  803927 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Resource efficiency is an explicit architectural requirement."
I0925 07:20:37.770203  803950 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "---"
I0925 07:20:37.969501  803956 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "13. WHATSAPP ARCHITECTURE"
I0925 07:20:38.275333  803899 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Maintain the existing WhatsApp bridge."
I0925 07:20:38.547254  803963 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Create dedicated routing for:"
I0925 07:20:38.634041  803902 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "MASTER"
I0925 07:20:38.869630  803969 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "ASKING & RESEARCH"
I0925 07:20:38.985133  804003 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "REPORTING"
I0925 07:20:39.066441  804023 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "ACTION"
I0925 07:20:39.266192  804031 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "PROJECT AGENTS"
I0925 07:20:39.451323  803974 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Suggested routing:"
I0925 07:20:39.570506  804000 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Personal 1-to-1:"
I0925 07:20:39.657656  803980 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "→ MASTER"
I0925 07:20:39.988668  804041 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Asking & Research channel:"
I0925 07:20:40.294491  804053 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "→ ASKING & RESEARCH"
I0925 07:20:40.505217  804069 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Reporting channel:"
I0925 07:20:40.635773  804099 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "→ REPORTING"
I0925 07:20:40.823646  804056 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Action channel:"
I0925 07:20:40.929982  804102 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "→ ACTION"
I0925 07:20:41.124938  804095 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Project groups:"
I0925 07:20:41.431992  804108 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "→ corresponding PROJECT AGENT"
I0925 07:20:41.677363  804112 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Security/critical incident:"
I0925 07:20:42.090855  804148 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "→ MASTER + REPORTING + ACTION as appropriate"
I0925 07:20:43.199459  804079 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Do not expose unrestricted Action Agent control directly through an ordinary project-agent group."
I0925 07:20:43.229400  804138 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "---"
I0925 07:20:43.693393  804143 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "14. ASKING & RESEARCH WHATSAPP BEHAVIOR"
I0925 07:20:43.865232  803507 http_helpers.go:305] URL: https://daily-cloudcode-pa.googleapis.com/v1internal:streamGenerateContent?alt=sse Trace: 0xf5fc31ef188acf1f ResponseID: vSC2av-ECv3F_PUP8faKiA4
I0925 07:20:44.774378  804211 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "The Asking & Research Agent must support general conversation."
I0925 07:20:45.095306  804227 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "For example:"
I0925 07:20:45.286472  804201 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "User:"
I0925 07:20:45.758471  804237 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "\"বর্তমানে MCP কীভাবে কাজ করে?\""
I0925 07:20:46.241570  804240 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Answer directly."
I0925 07:20:46.353848  804280 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "User:"
I0925 07:20:47.468732  804256 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "\"আমার Rust project-এর architecture দেখে বলো কোথায় সমস্যা।\""
I0925 07:20:47.997623  804338 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Inspect and answer."
I0925 07:20:48.150033  804310 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "User:"
