I0925 07:20:53.429742  804599 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "---"
I0925 07:20:53.854849  804618 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "15. MODERN AGENT ARCHITECTURE PRINCIPLES"
I0925 07:20:54.144531  804545 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Use the following principles:"
I0925 07:20:54.617680  804636 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "1. Supervisor / Principal orchestration"
I0925 07:20:54.885635  804645 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "2. Specialized agents"
I0925 07:20:55.096972  804647 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "3. Tool-based delegation"
I0925 07:20:55.376019  804650 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "4. Explicit task state"
I0925 07:20:55.908232  804668 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "5. Structured inter-agent messages"
I0925 07:20:56.363833  804671 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "6. Short-lived task context where possible"
I0925 07:20:57.097099  804701 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "7. Persistent project state outside raw conversation history"
I0925 07:20:57.161732  804543 http_helpers.go:305] URL: https://daily-cloudcode-pa.googleapis.com/v1internal:streamGenerateContent?alt=sse Trace: 0xa5ea2051c14f4f79 ResponseID: 1SC2apvPOOvu_uMP6fq1yAc
I0925 07:20:57.566942  804729 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "8. Evidence-based completion"
I0925 07:20:57.886980  804766 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "9. Independent verification"
I0925 07:20:58.538662  804734 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "10. Human approval for high-impact actions"
I0925 07:20:58.930234  804822 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "11. Least-privilege access"
I0925 07:20:59.277622  804845 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "12. Event-driven monitoring"
I0925 07:20:59.720645  804828 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "13. Retry with bounded limits"
I0925 07:20:59.971047  804882 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "14. Idempotent operations"
I0925 07:21:00.264298  804868 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "15. Rollback-aware changes"
I0925 07:21:00.646351  804873 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "16. Clear ownership of each task"
I0925 07:21:01.143456  804903 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "17. No uncontrolled agent swarm"
I0925 07:21:02.865452  804924 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Modern supervisor implementations similarly use controlled handoff tools, explicit state, structured outputs, memory/checkpointing and post-model validation hooks."
I0925 07:21:02.959923  804910 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "---"
I0925 07:21:03.453840  804962 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "16. THIRD-PARTY OPEN-SOURCE SOFTWARE POLICY"
I0925 07:21:04.295552  804955 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Do NOT install a third-party agent framework merely because it is popular."
I0925 07:21:05.427867  804811 http_helpers.go:305] URL: https://daily-cloudcode-pa.googleapis.com/v1internal:streamGenerateContent?alt=sse Trace: 0x680e5ae52bba1b08 ResponseID: 3CC2auLvDKyb_uMP6Nru0Qc
I0925 07:21:05.719881  805053 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "First determine whether AGY + shell + existing hooks + existing WhatsApp bridge can provide the capability."
I0925 07:21:06.618238  805101 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Potential future integrations may include:"
I0925 07:21:06.772673  805033 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "- MCP"
I0925 07:21:06.940162  805039 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "- LangGraph"
I0925 07:21:07.454974  805124 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "- other open-source orchestration libraries"
I0925 07:21:08.047724  805131 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "But only introduce one if it solves a concrete problem."
I0925 07:21:10.608456  805158 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "MCP should be considered primarily as a standardized tool/resource interface, not as a replacement for AGY itself. The current MCP TypeScript SDK v2 implements the July 28, 2026 specification and exposes tools, resources and prompts."
I0925 07:21:11.598370  805195 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Do not introduce a framework that requires a separate API key unless explicitly approved."
I0925 07:21:11.692153  805202 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "---"
I0925 07:21:11.939320  805198 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "17. MASTER MEMORY / STATE"
I0925 07:21:12.450660  805212 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Create a persistent global state mechanism."
I0925 07:21:12.650086  805167 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "At minimum maintain:"
I0925 07:21:12.942410  805221 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "\"/home/azureuser/AGY-MASTER/\""
I0925 07:21:13.161906  805236 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Suggested structure:"
I0925 07:21:13.248167  805269 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "AGENTS.md"
I0925 07:21:13.445409  805274 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "MASTER_STATE.md"
I0925 07:21:13.534897  805277 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "TASKS/"
I0925 07:21:13.637815  805279 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "INCIDENTS/"
I0925 07:21:13.728322  805246 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "ACTIONS/"
I0925 07:21:13.841627  805248 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "REPORTS/"
I0925 07:21:14.059765  805303 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "POLICIES/"
I0925 07:21:14.309536  805308 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "PROJECT_REGISTRY.md"
I0925 07:21:14.928717  805330 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Do NOT put huge raw transcripts into the Master context."
I0925 07:21:15.637720  805322 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Store durable state externally and load only relevant information."
I0925 07:21:15.714483  805354 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "---"
I0925 07:21:15.898040  805357 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "18. PROJECT REGISTRY"
I0925 07:21:16.277372  805339 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Create a central registry containing:"
