I0925 07:21:18.642506  805458 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "The Master and Reporting Agent should be able to read this registry."
I0925 07:21:19.629608  805475 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Project agents should not automatically gain unrestricted access to it."
I0925 07:21:19.688839  805478 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "---"
I0925 07:21:19.982458  805449 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "19. VERIFICATION REQUIREMENT"
I0925 07:21:20.378116  805455 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Before declaring the architecture complete:"
