I0925 07:21:39.220087  806690 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "If an existing \"AGENTS.md\", \"GEMINI.md\", or equivalent file already controls AGY behavior, do NOT blindly overwrite it."
I0925 07:21:39.388179  806607 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "First inspect it."
I0925 07:21:39.657771  806695 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Then determine whether:"
