I0925 07:53:07.212902  844297 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "তবে রিপোর্টে ৩টা critical correction দরকার।"
I0925 07:53:07.580880  844301 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "১. PreToolUse = সম্পূর্ণ safety boundary ধরে নেওয়া যাবে না"
I0925 07:53:08.388275  844581 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "এখানে Gemini নিজেই limitation স্বীকার করেছে—tmux, sudo, Docker, subprocess, systemd ইত্যাদি Antigravity tool hook-এর বাইরে যেতে পারে।"
I0925 07:53:08.584496  844571 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "তাই architecture-টা হবে:"
I0925 07:53:08.712953  844556 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Antigravity Policy"
I0925 07:53:08.775516  844558 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "+"
I0925 07:53:08.982907  844612 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "OS/User/Service Containment"
I0925 07:53:09.100081  844616 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "+"
I0925 07:53:09.227727  844607 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Filesystem Permission"
I0925 07:53:09.309733  844642 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "+"
I0925 07:53:09.472189  844648 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Process/Container Boundary"
I0925 07:53:09.984042  844625 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "শুধু policy_gateway.py দিয়ে “agent cannot cause harmful effect” guarantee করা যাবে না।"
I0925 07:53:10.238960  844661 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "বিশেষ করে তোমার audit-এর এই finding:"
I0925 07:53:10.437057  844675 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "> azureuser = NOPASSWD: ALL"
I0925 07:53:11.460680  844711 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "এটা সত্যি হলে সবচেয়ে বড় structural weakness। কারণ একই Linux identity-তে agent এবং safety controller থাকলে agent শেষ পর্যন্ত নিজের containment ভাঙার privilege পেতে পারে।"
I0925 07:53:11.550044  844688 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "---"
I0925 07:53:11.770378  844701 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "২. Fail-closed নিয়ে একটা subtle সমস্যা আছে"
I0925 07:53:11.840015  844703 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "Gemini লিখেছে:"
I0925 07:53:11.994482  844728 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "> Hook timeout → DENY"
I0925 07:53:12.970017  844749 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "কিন্তু Antigravity-এর documented hook contract-এ PreToolUse hook-এর timeout configuration আছে, আর hook-ই allow/deny decision ফেরত দেয়।"
I0925 07:53:13.707037  844789 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "কিন্তু “hook timeout হলে CLI অবশ্যই deny করবে”—এটা official documentation থেকে আমি নিশ্চিত করতে পারছি না।"
I0925 07:53:13.957616  844796 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "তাই production implementation-এ এভাবে লিখবে না:"
I0925 07:53:14.198850  844736 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "> “timeout automatically becomes deny.”"
I0925 07:53:14.262388  844803 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "বরং:"
I0925 07:53:15.290300  844822 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "> “We must experimentally verify timeout behavior on AGY 1.2.10; if native timeout behavior is fail-open, native hook alone cannot provide fail-closed guarantees.”"
I0925 07:53:15.409697  844826 input_loop.go:107] HandleUserInput called with text: "এটা খুব গুরুত্বপূর্ণ।"
